 r←Test_Misc_19(debugFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;T2
⍝ `GetTestTemplate` reports a clear error when the name is already used by something other than a function
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 #.⎕SHADOW'Temp'
 'Temp'#.⎕NS''
 T2←⎕NEW ##.Tester2 #.Temp
 #.Temp.Test_005←1
 :Trap 11
     T2.GetTestTemplate 5
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :Else
     →T.PassesIf∨/'The name <Test_005> is already taken!'⍷⎕DMX.EM
 :EndTrap

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
